<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Lega Nord official hymn</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2009</span><span class="sg-chain-h">adopted as party hymn</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Cabrini (film)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">sung in the film by a chorus of Italian children</span></li></ul></section>
